{
  "name": "GearUp 02 · Owner Ops AI Agent (Telegram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2️⃣ AI agent for the store owner\nAsk in plain language in Telegram:\n• *How much did we sell yesterday?*\n• *What is running out of stock?*\n• *Top-5 products this month*\n• *Any hot leads this week?*\n• *Create a promo code AUTUMN15 for 15% until Oct 31*\n\nThe agent decides which tools to call (read sheets, calculate, create promo). Only the owner's chat ID is allowed.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "15c13b06-f5f8-4414-ba17-604a5233e4db",
      "name": "Note 0",
